 "slot_change_request": "HBMA-SVC 10-17: d4f slot 146.88 x 146.88 holds 7,346 signal pins at 12.5 pins/um; pin-derived outline 432 x 388.8 (10 x 9 lattice cells): E svg K request 1,380 b (3.5/um), S controller K 2,488 b (5.8/um), N svg K response + long-haul VM/WB command + fills 2,319 b (5.4/um), W WB K port 1,156 b (3.0/um). vmks_NW* must be placed MX (controllers north of the NW band). Top = ot_hbm_svc_vm_kshare_splitstrap (strap sm -> sm_stream + sm_hbm, both tied to the SM index): die.v rebind needed.",
 "pin_regs": {
  "enable": false,
  "reason": "RTL registers every K pin in 2-entry pin skids (ot_hbm_svc_pin_skid2: valid/data/ready flops; out_v/out_data/in_r leave from flops), k_wr_done outputs and inputs are re-timed by flops, VM/WB commands land in stream pin flops, fills/fault leave from stream flops, straps land in one flop per domain. A kit pin stage cannot span the two async_gray_fifo domains and would add unpriced K-port latency."
 },
